<metadata><name>Day 32 - Glen Haffy, 7th Line Parking Access Trail</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.960477" lon="-79.979773"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>A parking lot located off the 7th Line immediately east of Airport Rd</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.962057" lon="-79.979313"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Continue straight onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading north-east. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.955883" lon="-79.969522"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Glen Haffy Side Trail, heading north-east. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.957405" lon="-79.952720"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turnaround point. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
